WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:00,980
three days

2
00:00:00,980 --> 00:00:03,380
I finally saw a living person, brother

3
00:00:03,380 --> 00:00:04,620
How good is your tricycle?

4
00:00:04,620 --> 00:00:05,860
Looks like it doesn’t waste any fuel

5
00:00:05,860 --> 00:00:06,980
It’s also convenient for loading things

6
00:00:06,980 --> 00:00:09,540
Wouldn't it be so miserable if you didn't put anything in the trunk?

7
00:00:09,540 --> 00:00:11,780
I didn't get any supplies. Is there something wrong?

8
00:00:12,420 --> 00:00:14,020
Now one bite is tighter than life.

9
00:00:14,020 --> 00:00:15,700
We are not a big boss like Dugu Qiufei.

10
00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:16,900
Not only did I get the district-wide notice,

11
00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:19,780
There are so many supplies that it’s like opening a supermarket to tell you the truth.

12
00:00:19,780 --> 00:00:21,380
I'm the younger brother of Dugu Boss

13
00:00:21,380 --> 00:00:22,660
These breads and yogurt

14
00:00:22,660 --> 00:00:24,020
That's what he rewarded me with

15
00:00:24,020 --> 00:00:25,380
I took in my little brother

16
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:26,420
How come I don't know

17
00:00:26,420 --> 00:00:29,860
I’m so envious, brother

18
00:00:30,180 --> 00:00:31,700
It’s not easy to see you either

19
00:00:31,700 --> 00:00:33,380
There is nothing in the rear rail box.

20
00:00:33,380 --> 00:00:36,180
I'll give this to you as I stutter. Thank you very much.

21
00:00:38,540 --> 00:00:39,820
This guy's rear rail box is a little bit smaller

22
00:00:39,820 --> 00:00:40,860
No supplies are packed

23
00:00:40,860 --> 00:00:42,900
Maybe it's a big deal

24
00:00:42,900 --> 00:00:44,420
Opened a space backpack
